WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Chihiro.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.500
We're almost there.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.500
What's this old building?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.200
It looks like an entrance.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.600
Get out of here now!

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.600
It's a bathhouse for the spirits.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.600
It's where they come to replenish themselves.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.200
And this is certainly no place for humans.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Don't be afraid. I just want to help you.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.600
Once you've met someone, you never really forget them.
